      "writtenOn": "2023-11-02T23:23:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "At this stage the whole set of pages used by this buffer are guaranteed to have been removed from the LRU list. The shrinker won\u0027t see this page until the last user calls `binder_alloc_free_buf()`.\n\nNote this is the same guarantee we provide when using `pages[i]-\u003epage_ptr` in `binder_alloc_copy_{to/from}_buffer()` calls without a lock.",
      "parentUuid": "1510ad7d_e04db0d1",
      "revId": "cba0dd82a60df879b05f8887eacf6faf78ab002b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
